  "description": "Genesys VTT 0.0.166 QA: adds a browsable Talent Library on the Character Sheet. The library reads Talents from Character Content Packs plus the system reference implementations, supports search and Tier/source filtering, detailed Talent inspection, XP cost display, Talent Pyramid legality checks, ranked Talent purchases, XP deduction, and creation of real embedded Talent Items consumed by the existing Rule Engine. The old Parry/Finesse/Second Wind QA grant buttons are removed from normal Talent-tab UX and replaced by Talent Library + Custom Talent. Preserves the 0.0.165 Character Creation Data Foundation and all prior combat, Actions, Rule Engine, narrative dice, and encounter work.",
